# Line endings for files in this repository.
#
# Windows batch files (.bat / .cmd) must have Windows (CRLF) line endings.
# With Unix (LF) line endings cmd.exe can fail to find the ':labels' that
# 'goto' jumps to, so IMPACT.bat could skip its error message and its pause.
# 'text eol=crlf' makes git store them normalised in the repository and write
# them with CRLF into every checkout and into GitHub's "Download ZIP",
# whatever the git settings of the computer are.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# The application icon is binary: git must never change bytes inside it.
*.ico binary
